{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/3186f1565950d9fbfd533be0208813da.avif?t=1766023423\" width=616 height=160 /></span><strong>&quot;Loafing Town&quot;</strong> is a <strong>desktop idle game</strong> designed for PC\u2014your ultimate workday distraction!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/659112d1c81350e53859729293f64870.poster.avif?t=1766023423\" width=688 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/659112d1c81350e53859729293f64870.webm?t=1766023423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/659112d1c81350e53859729293f64870.mp4?t=1766023423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Step into the role of a god-like overseer and build a thriving hero village. Starting with just a lone hero and a simple thatched hut, you'll gradually attract more heroes and transform your humble village into a bustling town.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/ae4ef7b7ddf628823bb71685f7d951de.poster.avif?t=1766023423\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/ae4ef7b7ddf628823bb71685f7d951de.webm?t=1766023423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/ae4ef7b7ddf628823bb71685f7d951de.mp4?t=1766023423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/f7cfa607b3978577ba8304f40ae747cb.avif?t=1766023423\" width=616 height=160 /></span>The gameplay is simple yet engaging: <strong>summon monsters</strong> to train heroes, <strong>earn gold</strong> to develop the village, <strong>upgrade houses and facilities</strong>, <strong>cast magic</strong> to assist heroes in battle, and even <strong>sacrifice heroes</strong> for unexpected rewards!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/3c7b2f17cec773d597ad485846197716.poster.avif?t=1766023423\" width=698 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/3c7b2f17cec773d597ad485846197716.webm?t=1766023423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/3c7b2f17cec773d597ad485846197716.mp4?t=1766023423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a <strong>god-view grabbing system</strong> and a <strong>physics-based interaction</strong>, the game delivers a delightful sandbox experience, perfect for idle play during work or study breaks. Watch your village grow and enjoy the laid-back charm of progression.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/b49849ed027a0658608ae4d9f764b619.poster.avif?t=1766023423\" width=698 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/b49849ed027a0658608ae4d9f764b619.webm?t=1766023423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/b49849ed027a0658608ae4d9f764b619.mp4?t=1766023423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625210/extras/2cd7d079722dbc3f51d599e14ec59e8e.avif?t=1766023423\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to slack off not only in the game but also in the community, come join us and chat together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please follow me on X! @Tenffy_Z</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like <i>Loafing Town</i>, don't forget to add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Easy Peasy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625210/625d490c07002285431e36950d415fdfdfebb229.jpg"},{"name":"New Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625210/7d91b08b17c54b11b32a524f65f30e13dbc2ffa0.jpg"},{"name":"Taking Shape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625210/1f31ca9a1cbfbe02b1918e23b6b6048cd8a2859b.jpg"},{"name":"Metropolis","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625210/4451f74318fa6c17c0819d44b9b3fbf19aac7c62.jpg"},{"name":"Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625210/d578635b827d1682c38315532ac3060b3bbbea67.jpg"},{"name":"Living Large","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625210/98a0d351462a61dfdddc3cf52095a91af0f3c2b9.jpg"},{"name":"First Small Goal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625210/b1a2fae227bd1d7bfff3d473f77d00cf4830d6ad.jpg"},{"name":"Cleared!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625210/2b105a95f40e1705ed211dac3110e58014aff5d3.jpg"},{"name":"Cycle I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625210/24aa349c7b204b65c0e1f28800d95922f8c40c5b.jpg"},{"name":"Cycle II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/stea